.TH "AG\-CLI\-RELEASE\-UPLOAD" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-release\-upload \- Upload an attachment to a release
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli release upload [<owner>/<repo>] <tag> <file> [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Upload a local file as an attachment to an existing release identified by its tag.
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-n, \-\-name <string>\fR
\&Remote attachment name (defaults to the local file's base name)
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-overwrite\fR
\&Delete an existing attachment with the same name before uploading
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-existing\fR
\&Do nothing and report success if an attachment with the same name already exists
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout <duration>\fR
\&Maximum attachment transfer time (0 disables the limit)
\&Default: \(dq30m0s\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli release upload owner/repo v1.0.0 ./dist/app.tar.gz
\&  ag\-cli release upload owner/repo v1.0.0 ./build/app.zip \-\-name app\-v1.zip
\&  ag\-cli release upload owner/repo v1.0.0 ./new.tar.gz \-\-overwrite
\&  ag\-cli release upload owner/repo v1.0.0 ./existing.tar.gz \-\-skip\-existing
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBag\-cli\-release\fR(1)
